.\" Manual page of the Lookin test fixture
.TH LOOKIN 1 "2026-10-29" "Lookin 1.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lookin \- look in your files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lookin
[\fB\-f\fR] [\fB\-s\fR \fIWxH\fR]
.RI [ directory ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Lookin
is a file explorer that previews
files in a blink.
It shows \(lqmost\(rq formats \(em text, images, archives.
.PP
Second paragraph.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-fullscreen
Start in full screen.
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-size\fR \fIWxH\fR
Window size, e.g.
.IR 1920x1080 .
.SS Examples
.nf
lookin ~/projects
lookin \-s 1280x800 .
.fi
.IP \(bu 2
First item.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ls (1),
.BR file (1)
